.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid\">\n                <!-- Service 1 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cold-room.webp\" alt=\"Walk-in Cold Room Repair Godhra\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Walk-in Cold Rooms</h3>\n                    <p>Complete diagnostics for positive and negative temperature walk-in chambers. We fix door seals, hinges, and cooling units efficiently.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-godhra\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue); font-weight:bold;\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 2 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Deep Freezer Repair Services Godhra\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Deep Freezers &#038; Blast Freezers</h3>\n                    <p>Specialized repair for blast freezers used in food processing. We ensure rapid cooling cycles are restored to preserve quality.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-godhra\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue); font-weight:bold;\">Learn More &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 3 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Cold-Room-Gas-Charging.webp\" alt=\"Cold Room Gas Charging Service\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Gas Charging &#038; Leak Repair</h3>\n                    <p>Detection of refrigerant leaks using advanced tools. We refill R404A, R22, and R134a gases for optimal cooling performance.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Service 4 -->\n                <div class=\"service-card\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Walkin-Freezer-Repair-Service.webp\" alt=\"Pharma Cold Storage Repair Godhra\" title=\"\">\n                    <h3>Pharma Cold Storage</h3>\n                    <p>Precision temperature calibration for medical cold storage and pharmaceutical units requiring strict compliance.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Brands We Service -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Brands We Service</h2>\n            <p>We provide expert third-party service for a wide range of local and international refrigeration brands. <em>Note: We are an independent service provider.</em></p>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Voltas</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Blue Star</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Carrier</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Bitzer (Compressors)</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Copeland</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Danfoss</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Rinac</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Lloyd</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Emerson</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Frick India</span>\n                <span class=\"btn\" style=\"background:#eee; color:#333; cursor:default;\">Alfa Laval</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Industrial Focus Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: #eef2f5;\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"flex\" style=\"align-items: center; gap: 40px; flex-direction: row-reverse;\">\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <h2>Specialized Service for Godhra GIDC &#038; Industrial Areas</h2>\n                    <p>Industries in Godhra require dependable cooling. Atlas Aircon provides priority <strong>Cold Room Repair Services Godhra</strong> for the Panchmahal industrial belt. We understand the specific needs of factories in <strong>Godhra GIDC</strong>, <strong>Vavadi</strong>, and nearby hubs like <strong>Halol</strong> and <strong>Kalol</strong>.</p>\n                    <ul style=\"list-style: none; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>Rapid Response:</strong> Technicians serving Godhra, Vavadi, and nearby GIDCs.</li>\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>AMC Services:</strong> Preventive maintenance contracts to avoid production downtime.</li>\n                        <li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">✅ <strong>Heavy Duty Repair:</strong> Handling screw and reciprocating compressors for large plants.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">Request GIDC Service</a>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                    <!-- Fallback SVG for industrial visual -->\n                    <div style=\"background: white; padding: 40px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                        <svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--dark-blue)\">\n                            <path d=\"M11 7l-3.2 9h1.9l.7-2h3.2l.7 2h1.9L13 7h-2zm-.15 5.65L12 9l1.15 