>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Digital Controller Repair/Replace</td>\n                        <td>₹3,000 &#8211; ₹6,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td>Door Seal/Gasket Replacement</td>\n                        <td>₹1,200 &#8211; ₹2,500</td>\n                        <td><a href=\"/shop\" style=\"color:var(--primary-blue);\">View Details</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p><small>*Note: Prices are indicative. Spare parts like compressors, expansion valves, and driers are charged extra at actuals.</small></p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Spare Parts Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: #f4f7f6;\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Genuine Cold Room Spare Parts Store</h2>\n            <p>Looking for high-quality spares? We stock a wide range of components for all cold room brands. Order online for fast delivery in Godhra.</p>\n            <div class=\"spares-grid\">\n                <a href=\"/capacitor\" class=\"spare-card\">Capacitors</a>\n                <a href=\"/complete-coil-assembly\" class=\"spare-card\">Complete Coil</a>\n                <a href=\"/contactors\" class=\"spare-card\">Contactor</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"spare-card\">Electric/Pneumatic Actuators</a>\n                <a href=\"/fan-blades\" class=\"spare-card\">Fan Blade</a>\n                <a href=\"/fan-motors\" class=\"spare-card\">Fan Motor</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Pros & Cons -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--light-bg);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Why Maintain Your Cold Room? (Pros &#038; Cons)</h2>\n            <div class=\"pros-cons-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"pros\">\n                    <h3>Advantages of Regular Maintenance</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>Extended equipment lifespan (up to 5 years more).</li>\n                        <li>Reduced energy bills by up to 20%.</li>\n                        <li>Prevention of costly emergency breakdowns.</li>\n                        <li>Maintains consistent temperature for product safety.</li>\n                        <li>Complies with food safety and pharmaceutical regulations.</li>\n                        <li>Quieter operation and less vibration.</li>\n                        <li>Higher resale value of equipment.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"cons\">\n                    <h3>Risks of Neglecting Service</h3>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>High risk of compressor burnout.</li>\n                        <li>Spoilage of expensive inventory (food/medicine).</li>\n                        <li>Increased electricity consumption.</li>\n                        <li>Frequent gas leakages.</li>\n                        <li>Ice formation on evaporator coils.</li>\n                        <li>Unexpected downtime during peak season.</li>\n                        <li>Safety hazards from electrical malfunctions.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Error Codes -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Common Cold Room Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            <p>Before calling us, check your controller display. Here are common codes for Dixell, Subzero, and Danfoss controllers:</p>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: E1 / P1</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> Room Probe Failure.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Check sensor connection or replace NTC probe.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: HA / Hi</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> High Temperature Alarm.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Check if door is open, condenser is dirty, or gas is low.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"background: #fff; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n                    <h4>Code: LA / Lo</h4>\n                    <p><strong>Meaning:</strong> Low Temperature Alarm.</p>\n                    <p><strong>Solution:</strong> Compressor contactor might be stuck on. Turn off immediately.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Areas Served -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--white);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Areas We Serve in Godhra</h2>\n            <p>We provide doorstep <strong class=\"bold-keyword\">Cold Room Repair Services Godhra</strong> across all neighborhoods, towns, and industrial zones.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"area-section\">\n                <h3>🏭 Industrial Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"area-list\">\n                    Godhra GIDC | Vavadi Industrial Estate | Bhamaiya | Paravdi | Halol GIDC (Nearby) | Kalol GIDC (Nearby) | Vejalpur | Shehra | Lunawada | Santrampur.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"area-section\">\n                <h3>🏠 Residential &#038; Commercial Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"area-list\">\n                    Bhuravav | Bamroli Road | Prabha Road | Civil Lines | Dahod Road | Lunawada Road | Modasa Road | Vorwad | Polan Bazar | Signal Falia | Chhabanpur | Jafrabad | Tuwa.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\" style=\"background: var(--light-bg);\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">1. How much does a cold room service visit cost in Godhra?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Visiting charges typically start from ₹500 within Godhra city, GIDC, and Vavadi. Repair costs depend on the diagnosis.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">2. Do you repair industrial cold storage units?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we specialize in industrial refrigeration, including walk-in coolers and deep freezers used in Godhra&#8217;s industries.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">3. What happens if my cold room compressor fails at night?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Atlas Aircon offers emergency support for contracted clients in Godhra and Vavadi. Call us immediately at +91 97272 57141.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">4. Do you provide warranty on spare parts?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we provide manufacturer warranty on replaced parts like compressors, controllers, and motors.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">5. Can you repair cold room doors and latches?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Absolutely. We repair door gaskets, hinges, latches, and sliding door mechanisms to prevent cooling loss.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">6. Why is ice forming on my cold room evaporator coil?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">This could be due to a faulty defrost timer, heater failure, or low gas pressure. We can diagnose and fix this.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">7. Which areas do you cover outside Godhra?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We serve nearby areas including Halol, Kalol, Shehra, Lunawada, and Santrampur.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">8. How often should a cold room be serviced?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">For commercial usage, we recommend preventive maintenance every 3 months to ensure efficiency.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">9. Do you repair Rittal Panel ACs?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we service panel ACs for CNC machines and server rooms in industrial areas. Check our Panel AC service page.</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\" onclick=\"toggleFaq(this)\">10. What payment methods do you accept?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We accept Cash, UPI, Bank Transfer, and Cheques for corporate clients.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Other Services Links -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3>Explore Our Other Cooling Services</h3>\n            <div class=\"flex\" style=\"gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n                <a href=\"/air-cooler-repair-services-godhra\" class=\"btn\" style=\"border:1px solid #ddd;\">Air Cooler Repair